9
00:00:40,466 --> 00:00:43,833
Maybe, the October 7th,

10
00:00:43,833 --> 00:00:50,600
maybe if we had done much more things,

11
00:00:52,066 --> 00:00:53,500
before...

12
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:57,066
Maybe, maybe,

13
00:00:57,100 --> 00:01:02,066
