19
00:01:15,066 --> 00:01:17,300
I don't care about them.

20
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:19,733
They are just...

21
00:01:25,066 --> 00:01:27,866
actors in this game.

22
00:01:31,766 --> 00:01:33,433
If we would...

23
00:01:34,300 --> 00:01:35,800
if we were...

24
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:41,733
If we had done it in another way,

25
00:01:42,533 --> 00:01:49,033
Maybe all this would never have come onto the world.

26
00:01:49,733 --> 00:01:52,366
All those damage, all those deaths

27
00:01:52,366 --> 00:01:54,233
on these pictures.

28
00:01:56,900 --> 00:02:01,400
Yuval had his 29ths birthday,

29
00:02:01,466 --> 00:02:04,066
just a day before October 7th

30
00:02:05,366 --> 00:02:09,366
Yuval was the favorite of my grandsons,

31
00:02:10,766 --> 00:02:13,266
they called him in Hebrew:

32
00:02:13,266 --> 00:02:14,900
"Dod Yuvi", uncle Yuvi

33
